ment\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_Item_(Black_Abbot)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable Item (Black Abbot)\">Upgradeable Item (Black Abbot)</a>: This item could be upgraded if you found a <a href=\"/page/Item:Seal_of_the_Black_Abbot\" title=\"Item:Seal of the Black Abbot\">Seal of the Black Abbot</a> to combine it with. Bring this item to the <a href=\"/page/Fountain_of_Necrotic_Might\" title=\"Fountain of Necrotic Might\">Fountain of Necrotic Might</a> outside the <a href=\"/page/Black_Mausoleum\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Black Mausoleum\">Black Mausoleum</a> and combine it with a Seal of the Black Abbot to upgrade the item to a more powerful form.</span></span>\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Lesser_Maximize\" title=\"Lesser Maximize\">Lesser Maximize</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Lesser_Maximize\" title=\"Lesser Maximize\">Lesser Maximize</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 12<br /><b>Charges: </b>3 (3/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 3 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:3) &#8594; <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Lesser_Maximize\" title=\"Lesser Maximize\">Lesser Maximize</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip